      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LA STIAVA (6) was well in the betting last time and ran a solid race at Albury over 1175m after being prominent at the bend. Those figures measure up nicely and have to think that we can see better still. XCEPTIONAL SPIRIT (3) was in a different class last time with a dominant all-the-way win by 4 lengths at Canberra Acton over 1080m. Got to bring that form to the grass now but will have every chance to do so and can give this a shake. Also off a win is CASCATA SPRITZ (4) who led throughout last time over 1200m at Cowra on soft going. Should be prominent again and gets down the hill no trouble on the home deck. DO YA HEAD IN (1) is also playing at home. Looks well placed so expect a better run this time.",
